    "text": "<p>Two particles <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> are moving on two concentric circles of radii <math><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> with equal angular speed <math><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>.</mo></math> At <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> their positions and direction of motion are shown in the figure:<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/dbaa5281-0ed6-49e3-9f88-ca21d905b2e3-image.png\" style=\"width: 309px; height: 300px;\" /></p><p>The relative velocity <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> at <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is given by:</p>",
